<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Verify Your Email</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px; }
    .code { font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2px; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px 15px; display: inline-block; margin: 15px 0; }
    .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Verify Your Email</h1>
  </div>
  
  <p>Hello,</p>
  
  <p>Thank you for signing up with {{appName}}. Please use the following verification code to complete your registration:</p>
  
  <div class="code">{{verificationCode}}</div>
  
  <p>This code will expire in 1 hour. If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>&copy; {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>